              </div>

              <div class="priority-card all">
                <span>COMPLETE</span>
                <h3>Miscellaneous</h3>
                <p>Complete the remaining Paper-I syllabus instead of leaving gaps.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2>Final Takeaway</h2>

            <p>
              The JPSC Preliminary Examination rewards candidates who can
              connect broad knowledge with the specific way the Commission
              frames questions. The syllabus tells you the boundaries. PYQs
              show the Commission's questioning pattern. Mock tests reveal
              whether you can convert preparation into marks.
            </p>

            <div class="final-box">
              <div class="final-step">
                <span>01</span>
